exports[`notice templates > recurring-due renders HTML and text without personal data 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Monday S&P 500 ETF buy is ready to sign

Your buy is ready

Your Monday buy of $20.00 in S&P 500 ETF is ready. Nothing is bought until you sign.

Not this time? Let it pass. Nothing happens, and the next one comes as planned.

Open it in Berth: https://www.berthmarkets.com/?open=SPY&side=buy&usd=20&run=sample

You get this because you set a recurring buy and its reminders are on.
Turn these off: https://www.berthmarkets.com/api/email/unsubscribe?t=sample-token

Berth. Wall Street, in your wallet."
`;

